<title>JAPAN: S&amp;P assigns AA+r rating to Denmark's samurais.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P assigns AA+r rating to Denmark's samurais.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's Corp (S&amp;P) said on Friday that it had assigned an AA+r foreign currency rating to Denmark's 10 billion yen worth of 4.1 percent dual currency yen/Australian dollar bonds due January 13, 2000.</p>
<p>The outlook is stable, S&amp;P said in a statement.</p>
<p>The &quot;r&quot; subscript indicates that the bonds carry risk other than credit risk, it said.</p>
</text>
